msgid ""
"Minimum unsupported width for an extrusion to apply the overhang flow to "
"it.\n"
"Can be in mm or in a % of the nozzle diameter.\n"
"If dynamic flow is used, then the dynamic flow will be computed between "
"0% unsupported (100% overlap) and this threshold."
msgstr ""
